{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hackjunction.app/participate/45/hackerpacks/53"}}{\fldrslt \cf0 \
BY QUALIA\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Qualia Platform\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 What you can do with the Qualia platform?
\f0\b0  Recorded episodes and not sure which ones are worth training on? A few bad takes can quietly drag a whole model down. Qualia helps you find them fast, so you train on your best data. 
\f1\b Upload your dataset:
\f0\b0  collect data with the SO-101 arms or Rokoko motion capture, then upload it to the Qualia platform. 
\f1\b Check every episode:
\f0\b0  quality checks flag failed takes, timing issues and inconsistent demos, so you don't have to watch every recording. 
\f1\b Curate:
\f0\b0  keep the good episodes and drop the rest. Every curated set is saved as a version, so you always know exactly what trained your model. 
\f1\b Export and train:
\f0\b0  download your curated dataset and train your policy, e.g. pi0.5 with LeRobot. 
\f1\b About Qualia
\f0\b0  Qualia is a robot learning company from Copenhagen. We help teams train robots on real tasks: collecting demonstrations, curating the data, training, and deploying on the robot. Our product, the Qualia platform, shows you which recorded episodes will make your robot better and which will quietly make it worse. The better your data, the better your robot, and with Qualia you see exactly what goes into every model you train.\
}}\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
